  "source": "JoyPro curated on the maker's photo (2026-10-11), PTO 2 seen from the front-left and slightly above, landing gear handle at the left edge, wing fold handle at the bottom right",
  "mappingSource": "catalog source = EDCD button map 4098BF05 \"WINCTRL CarrierAce PTO 2\" (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EDCD/EliteCustomButtonNames/main/files/INTO%20Bindings/DeviceButtonMaps/4098BF05.buttonMap), 1-41 each switch position its own button; no PTO 2 key-position drawing found (en.winwing.cn/en/download only lists the PTO 1 manual)",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "note": "Every switch position is its own part, so the positions of one switch (gear handle, launch bar, flaps, lights, anti skid, hook bypass, probe, select jett knob, hook handle, wing fold handle, park brake handle) share the same control; their markers sit on that control with small offsets so they stay readable. The offsets are not real positions. The yellow T-handle marked EMERG with TURN/PULL arrows is the park brake handle (PARK BRK / EMERG BRK labels); its shaft housing is the black cylinder to the right. The PROBE toggle bezel is hidden behind it; only the lever ball is visible. JETT STATION SELECT RI is hidden behind the HOOK handle and CTR is mostly hidden; NOSE/LEFT/RIGHT/HALF/FULL/FLAPS are indicator lights, not inputs.",
